(p027_proportional_navigation)
*title Two vehicle propnav intercept
*atmos none
*earth spherical gm=0 omega=0
*trajectory 1 interceptor start on 1
  *initial ecfc x=20925646.3255 y=0 z=0 xdt=0 ydt=0 zdt=0 time=0 mass=5
  *file interceptor.dat time xecfc yecfc relrng[2] relvel[2] yawi pitchi
  *segment 1 chase
    *integ dtprnt=0.25 dt=0.025 dtguid=3
    *inertial ecfc
    *prop thrust=(interceptor-thrust) mdot=(zero-mdot)
    *fly propnav=2
    *when time=20 stop
*trajectory 2 target start on 1
  *initial ecfc x=20925646.3255 y=1000 z=0 xdt=0 ydt=10 zdt=0 time=0 mass=1
  *file target.dat time xecfc yecfc
  *segment 1 coast
    *integ dtprnt=0.25 dt=0.025
    *when time=20 stop
*end
